wip/wgpu-native: Import wgpu-native-29.0.1.1

wgpu-native: native WebGPU implementation (C API: webgpu.h, wgpu.h) on
top of wgpu-core, with Metal, Vulkan, DX12 and GLES backends.  Built
from source with cargo (crates vendored through cargo-depends.mk);
installs libwgpu_native and the headers like the upstream release
archives, with the version that wgpu-py checks compiled in.
29.0.1.1 is the version wgpu-py 0.32.0 (wip/py-wgpu) targets.
